# Reflex video, part 2: the same guardian on a second plant, a simulated robot joint with a gravity load.
#   ./reflex-demo.sh start --plant joint ; ./rxctl script demo/video-joint.rxs
caption
guard on
wait-ai 20
caption Same guardian, different machine: a robot joint lifting a load (simulated)
wait 5
caption The AI's torque command sticks at full power. Guardian ON:
inject stuck
wait 5
clear
wait-ai 15
caption Same fault, guardian OFF: the joint slams into its stop
guard off
inject stuck
wait 4
clear
guard on
wait-ai 15
caption One kernel, one plant table: an exoskeleton, a rehab robot, a surgical arm
wait 6
caption Open source: github.com/ApratimPhadke/Reflex
wait 5
caption
